Wiki comparison composite of four source renditions for [[Blast The Door, Kid!]], from left to right:

# Gallery face: [https://web.archive.org/web/20071218114717id_/http://www.swccgpc.com/cards/anewhope/ls/blastthedoorkid.gif original archived PC gallery GIF], exact 18 December 2007 replay, historical filename <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">blastthedoorkid.gif</code>. [[:File:ANH-L-blastthedoorkid-pc2007.gif|Unchanged Wiki copy]]. The replay date is not a first-publication date.
# 2017 partial: [[:File:PC-Decipher-Errata-June-2017.pdf|complete official Decipher Errata sheet]] ([[Media:PC-Decipher-Errata-June-2017.pdf|download PDF]]), 1 June 2017 cover edition, original PDF page 24, Blast The Door, Kid! at top left. [[:File:ANH-L-blastthedoorkid-PC-June-2017-composed.png|Actual composed panel and rectangle/render recipe]].
# Full E: [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/022435b7929e4de26dafbcb1de2ec1d6d04d2153/Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/large/blastthedoorkid.gif exact Holotable-distributed GIF], commit 022435b7929e4de26dafbcb1de2ec1d6d04d2153, member <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/large/blastthedoorkid.gif</code>. [[:File:ANH-L-blastthedoorkid-PC-full-E-2018-import.gif|Unchanged member copy]].
# D-E1: [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/6c2273e5dc7fba63359a7ab12cd8f2bcc801b172/Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/hires/blastthedoorkid.png exact official PC PNG], commit 6c2273e5dc7fba63359a7ab12cd8f2bcc801b172, member <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/hires/blastthedoorkid.png</code>. The existing [[:File:ANH-L-blastthedoorkid.gif|Wiki native image]] is decoded-RGB pixel-identical; its file bytes differ.

The Wiki assembled these source images on an 1800×1000 white RGB canvas. Each input was converted to RGB and proportionally reduced, never enlarged, within 440×930 pixels; inputs were placed at (0,50), (450,50), (900,50) and (1350,50), with the labels at x+3,y=8 using Pillow’s default font, without retouching their printed contents. The sources retain their own copyright/credit. Original card design by Decipher; PC source renditions by the Players Committee. The Wiki composite is not another published PC version. Dates identify preserved occurrences, not unknown original publication days/order. Used for source comparison on this non-commercial fan wiki.